\begin{itemize}
\item[S1] ULAM.AI and the UnsolvedMath Contributors, UnsolvedMath, record 7800011 (AMR-077-0011). Catalogue curation under CC BY 4.0; definitions and English exposition added locally.
\url{https://huggingface.co/datasets/ulamai/UnsolvedMath}.
\item[S2] C. M. Newman and D. L. Stein, original contribution to Open Problems in Mathematical Physics (1998), edited by Michael Aizenman.
\url{https://web.math.princeton.edu/~aizenman/OpenProblems_MathPhys/9803.SpinGlass.html}.
\end{itemize}
\label{end:7800011}

